{"4008580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vapor Strange", "steam_appid": 4008580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>I added Bread to the Demo</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/658cb74d97ade38cc9a807fb93d27925.avif?t=1787943308\" width=630 height=200 /></span><br>Vapor Strange Demo Update 1.07<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>I added Bread to the game<br></li><li> You can skip to the next dialog line <br></li><li> Two New Modifier Cubes<br></li><li> Changed how some Modifiers Function<br></li><li> Camera Lens Warp effect added<br></li><li> New Objects and Pathways added<br></li><li> New Music<br></li><li> Some other hidden things<br></li><li> Bug Fixes</li></ul></p><br><h1>WE HIT 2K WISHLIST</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/fb1bc23ca35366baf37d467dcd7f6d43.poster.avif?t=1787943308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/fb1bc23ca35366baf37d467dcd7f6d43.mp4?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Thank you so much for all the support and helping me hit 2K Wishlist! I'm working hard on a massive update for the demo and stay tuned for some more crazy news :) we are just getting started!</p><br><h1>My new game- Vapor Strange!</h1><p>Hi I would like to thank you for showing interest in my new game! If you like The Indigo Parallel and LSD Dream Emulator you will also love Vapor Strange. As my 4th commercial game I am confident that this game will be something different that people will truly enjoy. I hope you will stick along for the ride!  <br>Cheers, Chris</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/37cdffd6d12df5be1710986dcc1b91de.poster.avif?t=1787943308\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/37cdffd6d12df5be1710986dcc1b91de.webm?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/37cdffd6d12df5be1710986dcc1b91de.mp4?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inspired by The Indigo Parallel and LSD Dream Emulator, Vapor Strange takes random procedural generation design to the next level. With hundreds of hand crafted assets to pull from, thousands of textures, a massive music library, Vapor Strange aims to be an experience like no other game.<br><br>The game loop is simple. Spawn into a generated level, find a weird creature or hidden pathway, and get transported to another generated world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/0bfc880763d947581e868ab3181ff133.poster.avif?t=1787943308\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/0bfc880763d947581e868ab3181ff133.webm?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/0bfc880763d947581e868ab3181ff133.mp4?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once a set number of levels are realized you get an ending, the game refreshes with a brand new ruleset and the game starts again with completely different visuals and level design.<br><br>The custom soundtracks are chosen from a pool of hundreds of songs which can be altered to fit the level. <br><br>During each playthrough you may encounter a modifier cube that will change something in the ruleset for that playthrough. These modifiers could be a texture alteration, color hue shifting, music pitch changes, the spawning of entities, and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/f941a60a41f2f9b88b14b4b26336b460.poster.avif?t=1787943308\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/f941a60a41f2f9b88b14b4b26336b460.webm?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/f941a60a41f2f9b88b14b4b26336b460.mp4?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With the retro aesthetics and thousands of assets to pull from, Vapor Strange provides each playthrough with a psychedelic experience that always will be different each playthrough.<br><br>If you are looking for a strange adventure, this game is for you.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/37cdffd6d12df5be1710986dcc1b91de.poster.avif?t=1787943308\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/37cdffd6d12df5be1710986dcc1b91de.webm?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/37cdffd6d12df5be1710986dcc1b91de.mp4?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inspired by The Indigo Parallel and LSD Dream Emulator, Vapor Strange takes random procedural generation design to the next level. With hundreds of hand crafted assets to pull from, thousands of textures, a massive music library, Vapor Strange aims to be an experience like no other game.<br><br>The game loop is simple. Spawn into a generated level, find a weird creature or hidden pathway, and get transported to another generated world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/0bfc880763d947581e868ab3181ff133.poster.avif?t=1787943308\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/0bfc880763d947581e868ab3181ff133.webm?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/0bfc880763d947581e868ab3181ff133.mp4?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once a set number of levels are realized you get an ending, the game refreshes with a brand new ruleset and the game starts again with completely different visuals and level design.<br><br>The custom soundtracks are chosen from a pool of hundreds of songs which can be altered to fit the level. <br><br>During each playthrough you may encounter a modifier cube that will change something in the ruleset for that playthrough. These modifiers could be a texture alteration, color hue shifting, music pitch changes, the spawning of entities, and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/f941a60a41f2f9b88b14b4b26336b460.poster.avif?t=1787943308\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/f941a60a41f2f9b88b14b4b26336b460.webm?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/extras/f941a60a41f2f9b88b14b4b26336b460.mp4?t=1787943308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With the retro aesthetics and thousands of assets to pull from, Vapor Strange provides each playthrough with a psychedelic experience that always will be different each playthrough.<br><br>If you are looking for a strange adventure, this game is for you.", "short_description": "Explore bizarre procedural generated psychedelic worlds, encounter surreal creatures, experience shifting rulesets, retro aesthetics, and altered music for a wild and truly strange experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/fd4be1c5cf61d719cac46d22cad1b2ecae328b92/header.jpg?t=1787943308", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/a03b880f25f529e2951ce24fd8a64697cd09d7e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787943308", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008580/a03b880f25f529e2951ce24fd8a64697cd09d7e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787943308", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce 450 or higher with 1GB Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2026, Chris Danelon, all rights reserved", "developers": ["Chris Danelon"], "publishers": ["Chris Danelon"], "demos": [{"appid": 4645030, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false